// IntroString :
"P3916993855" "Listen, {TaskForceName}, I don't care what you read in the paper, Countess Crey is not the humanitarian she pretends to be. I need you to help me find out what's going on behind the scenes. I've been contacted by a man named Drake. He's a Crey employee, but he wants to get out. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to get Drake to safety.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1007162935" "Get Drake to safety"
// SendOffString :
"P2627149096" "If you walk this path with me, you may often find yourself in the shadows. I don't operate like Positron and the others. I hope you're ready for it."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1173515919" "Defeat all security forces"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2959025965" "Crey isn't going to wait on you, {TaskForceName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3468642309" "The security code Manticore provided works like a charm."
