// Dialog :
"P1327735548" "At least you are as good as your reputations. Drake's grateful that you got him out of that Crey facility, and he's told me a lot about the sinister goings-on at Crey. I think we may be getting into deep waters here. Countess Crey won't be happy about someone coming after her."
// RandomFameString :
"P2219295278" "Did you hear about the incident at Crey? The papers say it might have been some kind of illegal hero investigation."

