// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4060038364" "That ex-Crey employee gave me one last bit of info before I shuffled him off to my version of witness protection. According to Drake, there's a Crey research facility that's trying to meld Rikti technology into a computer network. I'm not sure what they're trying to accomplish, but it can't be good. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Shut down that research facility and bring back any records you can salvage.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3565408832" "Shut down the research facility"
// SendOffString :
"P1474843140" "Security is bound to be heavy at this place, watch your backs."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P167762195" "Defeat all forces in lab"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P759245266" "I know you have somewhere else to be."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4210830141" "Once again, Manticore's security code works perfectly. With a twinge of unease, you enter the facility."
