"P2959568597" "Hawkins"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1014241099" "What we do here, stays here."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4058204785" "Do whatever you have to! Our secrets must be maintained!"

