// Dialog :
"P2949009333" "So Friedkin contacted you through the computer, huh? I have to admit, I've heard of this character before. The most common theory is that she has become some sort of AI. Since I know her body was found in the sewers, it seems like the only possible situation. I hope you're ready to go after the big fish. Now that Friedkin's passed on Countess Crey's itinerary, we may be able to catch her while she's involved in one of Crey's illicit acts."
// RandomFameString :
"P2685677853" "Rumor has it that {TaskForceName} is being investigated by the authorities for illegal search and seizure."

