// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4022770369" "According to the file Friedkin passed on, the countess will be touring one of their illegal operations in Crey's Folly today. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Get over there and catch with her hand in the cookie jar.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P877566843" "Catch Countess Crey"
// SendOffString :
"P721340132" "If she's on site, expect heavy security. Watch out for her personal bodyguard, Hopkins."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3792563308" "Defeat security chief, his men"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2179669656" "We won't have many chances to catch the countess red-handed. This is one of them. Don't blow it."

