// Dialog :
"P4044355940" "I have to admit, I'm impressed. That was an overwhelming force and they clearly knew you were coming. I knew something didn't feel right. Either Friedkin set you up, or someone else is pulling our strings. I'm going to get Citadel to analyze the disc with that last message from Friedkin. Maybe he can figure this out."
// RandomFameString :
"P494997749" "Word on the street is that Manticore is impressed with {TaskForceName}. That doesn't happen very often."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3035656829" "I knew something felt wrong. You are lucky to have gotten out of there alive. Either Friedkin set you up, or someone else is pulling our strings. I'm going to get Citadel to analyze the disc with that last message from Friedkin. Maybe he can figure this out."
// RandomFameString :
"P646755316" "Manticore is pissed about something. I overheard him talking to Citadel about some kind of set up. He was not a happy camper."

