// IntroString :
"P4176309932" "Well, I had Citadel take a look at the disc with the last massage from Friedkin. It turns out it was sent by a different person entirely! The countess lured you into a trap; now, the chess game continues. Ms. Liberty just contacted me. Apparently Crey isn't through with you yet. A member of the Paragon City Council has been kidnapped, and the following note was left: 'If {TaskForceName} doesn't respond to this threat, we will kill Councilman Birch.' <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You better get over to Ms. Liberty as soon as possible.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1125942233" "Go to Ms. Liberty"
// SendOffString :
"P4126753281" "Get that politician back safely, {TaskForceName}, or your reputation will suffer."

