"P3795173346" "You are not going to believe this. Countess Crey's personal bodyguard, Hopkins, just contacted me. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>He says if you can take out 40 of his men over in Crey's Folly, he'll take you on himself.</A> Apparently he is taking your interest in his employer personally."
// AcceptString :
"P197873808" "Take out 40 Crey men in Crey's Folly"
// SendOffString :
